# Route: guide 18 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 37 to
# 39, 23 quests, 4.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Arathi Highlands, Badlands): Faldir's Cove -> Agmond's End -> Valley
# of Fangs -> Agmond's End -> Valley of Fangs -> The Maker's Terrace ->
# Agmond's End -> Kargath -> Apocryphan's Rest -> Kargath -> The Dustbowl ->
# Kargath -> The Dustbowl -> ….
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 5146 Elemental
# Leatherworking; 6622 Triage; 1559 Flash Bomb Recipe; 2203 Badlands Reagent
# Run II; 5145 Dragonscale Leatherworking.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Dragonmaw Rumors (95663), Find the Gems and Power Source
# (2339), Disharmony of Fire (3907), Commander Gor'shak (3981), The Rise of
# the Machines (4063), KILL ON SIGHT: Dark Iron Dwarves (4081), KILL ON SIGHT:
# High Ranking Dark Iron Officials (4082), Operation: Death to Angerforge
# (4132), Lost Thunderbrew Recipe (4134), Ribbly Screwspigot (4136), The Pack
# Mistress (4724), Kibler's Exotic Pets (4729), The Darkstone Tablet (4768),
# En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (4862), Warlord's Command (4903), Operative Bijou (4981).

